      "present": false,
      "url": "https://example.com/",
    },
    "remediation": "Consider adding Strict-Transport-Security with a suitable max-age once the whole site works over HTTPS.",
    "ruleId": "HTTP-002",
    "severity": "low",
    "title": "Security header not observed: Strict-Transport-Security",
  },
  {
    "description": "The X-Content-Type-Options header was not observed in the response from https://example.com/. The nosniff value stops browsers from guessing content types, which can reduce some content-confusion issues.",
    "evidence": {
      "header": "X-Content-Type-Options",
      "present": false,
      "url": "https://example.com/",
      "value": null,
